\f1  
\f2 \uc0\u1500 \u1456 \u1505 \u1460 \u1497 \u1490 
\f1  - "the house of Israel has become dross 
\i to me
\i0 " - asserts divine assessment as objective reality regardless of their self-perception.\
The fury poured out (
\f2 \uc0\u1513 \u1464 \u1473 \u1508 \u1463 \u1499 \u1456 \u1514 \u1460 \u1468 \u1497 
\f1  
\f2 \uc0\u1495 \u1458 \u1502 \u1464 \u1514 \u1460 \u1497 
