\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 We already talked about the cleansing themes into the deluge of the third oracle. Wrath poured out and fire of the LORD's fury are both verbal and thematic links between the second and the third oracles. Bloodshed, predation, princes, the vulnerable, and profanation are links between the first and third.\
More subtly, an audience listening to the first oracle indict rulers might have thought some hope remained in others. But the third oracle extends the indictment to the people of the land, a far broader category. Today, we might say 'citizen' or 'middle class'. They too were engaged in bloodshed.
